          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Angel Food Cake is the flagship and the most versatile, working in shakes, oats and most sweet baking. Buttery Blend is the pick for savory recipes, and Brownie Batter is the chocolate option. Taste is personal and we did not taste-test the range, so sample packs are the cheapest way to find your favorite."
