          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Devotion Nutrition makes one of the more thoughtful flavored proteins on the market, built around a whey isolate and casein blend that works in the kitchen as well as the shaker. Angel Food Cake and Buttery Blend in particular do things most protein powders cannot.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
